{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41465","headline":"醉中惜花更书与诸从事 · 李建勳","name":"醉中惜花更书与诸从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公退寻芳已是迟，莫因他事更来稀。\n未经旬日唯忧落，算有开时不合归。\n歌槛宴余风褭褭，闲园吟散雨霏霏。\n高楼鼓绝重门闭，长爲抛回恨解衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41465.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41465","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}